WEBVTT

00:00:06.372 --> 00:00:09.341
Disgaea

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:15.637
It's like I'm tied up tight
by the sighs of love.

00:00:15.748 --> 00:00:20.708
I can't break free
no matter what spell I try.

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:28.426
Tranquil eyes that conceal
sorrow behind them...

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:33.659
...throw my heart into turmoil
more than they ought to.

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:42.205
You mean more to me
than I do,

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:48.440
...even though we both refuse
to admit to our feelings.

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:54.612
You're the one for me.
I don't care if you're a demon.

00:00:55.188 --> 00:01:01.320
Oh, this is a miracle that
I've stumbled upon.

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:07.832
Even these wounds that never fade,
even this profound karma.

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:11.165
Oh, I'll give you
my love.

00:01:11.371 --> 00:01:13.669
Time and again,
no matter where you are.

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:22.308
I'll give you my love.

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:38.697
Okay, Thursday,
try starting her up!

00:01:39.132 --> 00:01:41.692
ROGER.
STARTING ENGINE.

00:01:46.572 --> 00:01:48.540
Finally... Finally!

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:50.575
Repairs to the ship
are finally finished!

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:55.976
Our days of meekly slaving away at part-time
jobs here in the Netherworld are over, too!

00:01:56.482 --> 00:01:58.313
Let's go, Jennifer!
Thursday!

00:01:58.484 --> 00:02:01.453
Gordon, Defender of Earth,
lifting off!

00:02:05.091 --> 00:02:11.052
Space Battleship Gargantua

00:02:13.266 --> 00:02:17.862
Highness, maybe we should've
taken the long way...

00:02:18.337 --> 00:02:19.304
Be quiet!

00:02:19.405 --> 00:02:23.171
YOU were the one who said this would be the
quickest way back to the Overlord's Castle!

00:02:23.443 --> 00:02:25.434
Well, Flonne's having
a little trouble...

00:02:25.545 --> 00:02:26.807
What?!

00:02:31.084 --> 00:02:33.518
This hill is
really steep!

00:02:36.155 --> 00:02:37.622
What was that?

00:02:41.627 --> 00:02:43.754
So, you're still hanging
around here, I see!

00:02:43.963 --> 00:02:45.726
Why, if it isn't
Mr. Gordon!

00:02:45.865 --> 00:02:51.201
Feast your eyes on this, ladies and demons!
My spaceship is finally back among the living!

00:02:52.338 --> 00:02:55.933
That's terrific news!
Congratulations!

00:02:56.442 --> 00:03:01.846
Now, then, Prince of the Netherworld! I demand
that you face me fair and square this time!

00:03:02.148 --> 00:03:03.672
All right, Defender of Earth!

00:03:03.783 --> 00:03:08.948
Out of respect for your tenacious pursuit,
I will accept your challenge!

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:10.146
You really mean it?!

00:03:10.256 --> 00:03:14.420
Wow, THIS is a first. The Prince is
gonna fight a duel fair and square?

00:03:14.861 --> 00:03:16.692
What brought on this
sudden change of heart?

00:03:17.096 --> 00:03:20.759
Surely it's because the seeds of righteousness
have begun to blossom in his heart!

00:03:21.167 --> 00:03:23.897
Even demons have an innate sense
of right and wrong!

00:03:24.437 --> 00:03:25.233
As if.

00:03:25.338 --> 00:03:27.704
I know the perfect place
for our fight!

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:30.941
How about it? I'll show you the way,
so will you fight me there?

00:03:31.043 --> 00:03:33.375
Very well!
Lead the way!

00:03:35.248 --> 00:03:36.579
Now this is more like it!

00:03:36.682 --> 00:03:38.377
This is so amazing!

00:03:38.985 --> 00:03:40.452
This is really neat, too!

00:03:40.653 --> 00:03:42.018
And this is great, too!

00:03:42.188 --> 00:03:43.212
And so's this!

00:03:43.322 --> 00:03:45.222
You're terrific too,
Thursday!

00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:50.852
Don't skimp on the compliments! Jennifer built
Thursday here to be the ultimate robot!

00:03:50.963 --> 00:03:54.091
Wow! Jennifer built
Thursday herself?

00:03:54.667 --> 00:03:58.660
That's right! In addition to being my sidekick,
she's also a scientific genius!

00:03:58.771 --> 00:04:01.899
She's the partner that I trust more
than anyone else in the world!

00:04:02.141 --> 00:04:04.302
Oh! What's this book?

00:04:06.279 --> 00:04:08.270
That book isn't meant for
the eyes of children!

00:04:09.415 --> 00:04:10.313
Hey, that's...

00:04:11.584 --> 00:04:13.211
Why, this is the
Demon Tome!

00:04:13.319 --> 00:04:16.482
Wow! We spent all that time looking for it,
and it was here all along?

00:04:16.589 --> 00:04:17.749
The "Demon Tome"?

00:04:18.224 --> 00:04:19.885
I can't believe it was here
the whole time...

00:04:19.992 --> 00:04:21.721
Would someone please tell me
what this "Demon Tome" is?

00:04:21.827 --> 00:04:26.491
It's a very important book. Whoever owns it
is recognized as the legitimate Overlord.

00:04:26.899 --> 00:04:28.161
You don't say...

00:04:28.367 --> 00:04:31.063
Just a minute, now.
As I recall, inside it was a bunch of...

00:04:31.204 --> 00:04:33.934
THE KIND OF THINGS THAT MAKE GUYS
START TO PANT.

00:04:35.041 --> 00:04:37.441
What are you supposed to use
the stuff in here for?

00:04:37.543 --> 00:04:39.738
What, don't you know?
Usually, guys use it to...

00:04:42.048 --> 00:04:43.572
What a noisy human...

00:04:43.683 --> 00:04:46.174
I'll explain it to you later,
Flonne.

00:04:46.285 --> 00:04:48.549
More to the point, a book like THIS
proves that you're Overlord?

00:04:48.988 --> 00:04:52.446
You two don't understand the true
significance of this book.

00:04:52.558 --> 00:04:56.187
Oh, so you know what you're supposed
to do with this stuff, Highness?

00:04:56.629 --> 00:04:58.597
Drop the innuendo!
You'll see soon enough.

00:05:01.133 --> 00:05:03.431
All right, human,
Take us across this mountain.

00:05:03.603 --> 00:05:05.195
Crossing mountain, aye!

00:05:07.573 --> 00:05:08.904
Set us down
at that castle.

00:05:09.275 --> 00:05:11.038
Setting down, aye!

00:05:13.045 --> 00:05:14.603
What a fine castle!

00:05:14.714 --> 00:05:18.115
A fitting place for the final showdown between
the Overlord and the Defender of Earth!

00:05:25.391 --> 00:05:27.552
Wait here. I'll go make the
necessary arrangements.

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:30.326
I'll be waiting!
I look forward to our duel!

00:05:30.997 --> 00:05:32.897
You're quite a tactician,
Highness!

00:05:32.999 --> 00:05:35.467
The way you got us here
without walking was sheer genius!

00:05:37.003 --> 00:05:39.528
All humans are good for
is providing taxi service!

00:05:39.639 --> 00:05:41.072
I'm guessing that there isn't
gonna be a fight, either?

00:05:41.207 --> 00:05:43.641
Of course not.
Why should I waste my time?

00:05:44.744 --> 00:05:47.076
So, who lives in
this castle?

00:05:47.179 --> 00:05:49.272
This is my castle!
The Overlord's Castle!

00:05:50.349 --> 00:05:53.910
Oh, so we finally made it
to your home, Laharl!

00:06:12.738 --> 00:06:14.103
I finally made it back!

00:06:14.307 --> 00:06:16.332
Gosh, this place could
do with a cleaning...

00:06:16.642 --> 00:06:18.371
Want me to call in
the Prinny Squad?

00:06:18.511 --> 00:06:20.035
No, that won't
be necessary.

00:06:49.075 --> 00:06:51.305
I hereby lay claim
to the throne!

00:06:51.777 --> 00:06:55.110
He who possesses the Demon Tome
shall be Overlord!

00:06:55.514 --> 00:06:57.072
I am Laharl!

00:06:57.383 --> 00:07:00.841
Hear me, Demon Tome!
Grant your power unto me!

00:07:38.824 --> 00:07:40.121
What in the world
is that?!

00:08:09.054 --> 00:08:12.990
NOW ENACTING
DIRECTIVE 294.

00:08:13.359 --> 00:08:15.759
TRANSMITTING GUIDE BEACON.

00:08:20.633 --> 00:08:23.193
What do you mean?
What's going on here, Thursday?

00:08:23.302 --> 00:08:25.497
Thursday! I don't believe it!
Are you...

00:08:25.971 --> 00:08:30.499
NOW ENGAGING SECONDARY BEHAVIOR
PROGRAM SEQUENCE.

00:08:52.631 --> 00:08:55.259
Now I'm finally
the true Overlord.

00:08:55.534 --> 00:08:57.798
Congratulations, Laharl!

00:08:58.037 --> 00:09:00.733
So I guess you just needed
the cover to be Overlord,

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:03.308
...and the cheesecake pics inside
are there for other reasons, huh?

00:09:04.376 --> 00:09:07.004
Uh, Highness?
The floor is shaking.

00:09:07.213 --> 00:09:09.204
Are you doing this, too?

00:09:09.381 --> 00:09:12.145
I don't know what it is.
I'm not the one doing it.

00:09:15.387 --> 00:09:19.323
What's going on? Jennifer,
is Thursday malfunctioning?

00:09:19.558 --> 00:09:21.753
No, this was supposed
to happen.

00:09:22.828 --> 00:09:24.762
It's for the best.

00:09:33.739 --> 00:09:35.604
What just happened?!

00:09:51.023 --> 00:09:55.255
It's the Gargantua,
Earth's mightiest space battleship!

00:09:56.896 --> 00:10:00.093
That's so cool!
I want one!

00:10:00.266 --> 00:10:01.995
It's too amazing
for words!

00:10:02.101 --> 00:10:05.002
One of those?! Lady, you've got
some strange hobbies...

00:10:05.104 --> 00:10:10.269
Now I see! They must be here to cheer me on
in my final battle against the Prince!

00:10:10.609 --> 00:10:12.770
Oh, what a heartening sight
this is!

00:10:12.878 --> 00:10:18.475
Hey! I'm down here!
Can you see me, everyone?!

00:10:29.695 --> 00:10:30.559
This isn't right.

00:10:30.663 --> 00:10:31.960
What isn't?

00:10:32.064 --> 00:10:35.966
Humans have stumbled into the Netherworld
every now and again over the years.

00:10:36.769 --> 00:10:42.298
But THIS... They're deliberately creating
a rift in the fabric of space itself!

00:10:44.376 --> 00:10:48.176
Are humans really capable
of doing that?

00:10:48.581 --> 00:10:49.980
It sure looks
that way.

00:10:50.082 --> 00:10:51.071
You did this?!

00:10:51.183 --> 00:10:54.414
No! I couldn't possibly
have called them here!

00:10:54.753 --> 00:10:57.517
But surely they are here
to assist the Defender of...

00:11:19.979 --> 00:11:24.313
Why?! I don't understand!
They're not here to cheer me on?!

00:11:24.416 --> 00:11:27.874
You fool! This is an all-out invasion
of the Netherworld by you humans!

00:11:28.921 --> 00:11:30.388
An invasion?

00:11:30.756 --> 00:11:33.725
Humanity would never do
such a terrible thing!

00:11:33.826 --> 00:11:37.125
No, Gordon.
What he says is true.

00:11:38.497 --> 00:11:41.989
This was all planned by my father
for the good of Earth.

00:11:42.368 --> 00:11:46.862
Your father? But you told me that your parents
both passed away when you were a little girl!

00:11:47.606 --> 00:11:52.043
Her foster father is Supreme Commander
Carter of the Earth Defense Force!

00:11:55.748 --> 00:11:56.976
Wait, you're...!

00:12:01.954 --> 00:12:03.922
Disgaea

00:12:05.057 --> 00:12:10.927
Disgaea

00:12:17.736 --> 00:12:18.600
Wait, you're...!

00:12:18.704 --> 00:12:20.501
It's been a long time,
Gordon!

00:12:20.906 --> 00:12:24.000
Kurtis, Defender of Earth,
has arrived!

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:28.073
Oh, wow! Now the hero's
archrival has appeared!

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:30.307
Flonne, you're WAY
too into this.

00:12:48.434 --> 00:12:51.801
So, foul demons, I see that you're
not putting up a fight at all!

00:12:52.304 --> 00:12:56.206
But that is good news for us.
The Netherworld will belong to humanity.

00:12:56.642 --> 00:12:59.770
This is the only way
to save Earth!

00:13:00.345 --> 00:13:03.610
Commander! Someone is
closing in on us at high speed!

00:13:03.716 --> 00:13:06.776
Ignore it! It's not as if these demons
can do anything to stop us!

00:13:07.119 --> 00:13:10.680
After all, this grand armada of ours
is made up of two million ships!

00:13:10.989 --> 00:13:14.186
Flying object detected on scopes!
Transferring to main screen!

00:13:16.428 --> 00:13:20.558
What a fool! What can one lowly
demon do against us?!

00:13:20.666 --> 00:13:22.964
All right, you stupid
human weaklings!

00:13:23.202 --> 00:13:26.535
It's time for you to learn the hard way
the terror that is the Overlord!

00:13:33.278 --> 00:13:35.178
126th Fleet destroyed!

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:38.579
The Olympus, flagship of the 412th Fleet,
has been destroyed!

00:13:38.684 --> 00:13:42.643
Receiving a transmission from the
15th Fleet! "Unable to fight!" I repeat...

00:13:42.788 --> 00:13:43.755
Impossible!

00:13:44.089 --> 00:13:49.823
One lone demon is making mincemeat
out of our 2 million ship space armada?!

00:13:50.596 --> 00:13:52.086
I can't believe it!

00:13:52.798 --> 00:13:56.495
Why do you not use the weapon
which I entrusted to you?

00:13:56.602 --> 00:14:00.902
Humanity will secure their future
with their own two hands!

00:14:01.607 --> 00:14:03.802
I appreciate all that you
have done for us.

00:14:03.942 --> 00:14:07.901
Nevertheless, this battle is between
us humans and the Netherworld.

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:11.106
Goodness, you've become an
idealist at this late date?

00:14:11.216 --> 00:14:12.410
I'm just...

00:14:12.918 --> 00:14:15.648
87th and 89th Fleets
report severe damage!

00:14:15.788 --> 00:14:18.416
The 101st Fleet is completely
dead in space, too!

00:14:21.827 --> 00:14:26.025
This is great! It's like we're watching a final
throwdown between two lifelong rivals!

00:14:26.131 --> 00:14:28.031
Flonne, you are WAY
too happy about this!

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:36.469
Gordon, hang in there!

00:14:36.842 --> 00:14:41.404
I don't understand... Why are
you doing this, Kurtis?

00:14:46.885 --> 00:14:48.785
A buffoon like you
has no need to know.

00:14:49.254 --> 00:14:50.915
Thursday, do it.

00:14:51.023 --> 00:14:51.990
ROGER.

00:14:59.698 --> 00:15:01.165
Let go of me,
damn it!

00:15:01.266 --> 00:15:03.131
Please put us down!

00:15:03.368 --> 00:15:04.960
This won't hold me!

00:15:06.572 --> 00:15:07.766
Etna!

00:15:08.407 --> 00:15:11.865
I SUGGEST THAT YOU REFRAIN FROM
TRYING ANYTHING FOOLISH.

00:15:12.144 --> 00:15:13.577
Stop this, Thursday!

00:15:13.679 --> 00:15:17.206
You STILL haven't caught on?
You've been used.

00:15:17.316 --> 00:15:18.214
What?!

00:15:23.722 --> 00:15:27.180
Now then, Princess.
The Supreme Commander awaits.

00:15:27.292 --> 00:15:28.589
Father is waiting?

00:15:28.694 --> 00:15:32.494
The Commander ordered me to come here
and rescue you and you alone.

00:15:32.798 --> 00:15:36.564
You see, we can't attack the
Overlord's Castle with you here.

00:15:36.668 --> 00:15:40.365
No! I'm not going anywhere!
I'm staying here with Gordon!

00:15:40.939 --> 00:15:43.305
We should never have gone
through with this!

00:15:43.742 --> 00:15:47.542
Even you would understand that if you saw
the demons' world for yourself, Kurtis!

00:15:48.647 --> 00:15:50.911
The Netherworld has
its own daily rhythms.

00:15:51.016 --> 00:15:54.349
The demons try to live as best
they can, just like we do!

00:15:54.853 --> 00:15:57.014
We have no right to take
that away from them!

00:15:57.656 --> 00:15:59.521
Now, now, this disobedience
won't do at all.

00:15:59.625 --> 00:16:02.492
I COULD finish Gordon off
right here if you like.

00:16:02.594 --> 00:16:04.494
The man calls himself
the Defender of Earth,

00:16:04.596 --> 00:16:07.087
but he can't even deal with
the Overlord by himself.

00:16:08.667 --> 00:16:11.932
Jennifer! Don't give in
to his threats!

00:16:12.037 --> 00:16:14.130
Justice always triumphs
in the end!

00:16:14.239 --> 00:16:15.035
Oh, shut up!

00:16:15.440 --> 00:16:17.465
How can you treat a defenseless
person like that?!

00:16:17.576 --> 00:16:20.568
I'm warning you, you're really
starting to piss me off!

00:16:21.413 --> 00:16:22.277
I'll go with you.

00:16:22.381 --> 00:16:23.075
Good girl.

00:16:23.181 --> 00:16:24.079
Jennifer!

00:16:24.182 --> 00:16:28.551
Jennifer, don't do it! Don't do anything
that goes against your beliefs!

00:16:28.687 --> 00:16:31.451
Remember, you're the partner
of the Defender of Earth!

00:16:32.424 --> 00:16:35.951
Maybe I spent too long
by your side.

00:16:37.062 --> 00:16:40.054
I'm the one who deserves
to be punished.

00:16:43.001 --> 00:16:44.161
Jennifer...

00:16:45.938 --> 00:16:48.566
JENNIFER!

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:53.771
That big one is
going down next!

00:16:53.879 --> 00:16:55.141
Demon closing in!

00:16:55.247 --> 00:16:58.876
Fire! Fire! Fire!
Fire everything you've got!

00:16:59.217 --> 00:17:01.208
Shoot down
that demon!

00:17:16.668 --> 00:17:17.930
Who are you?

00:17:18.036 --> 00:17:20.266
Kurtis, Defender of Earth.

00:17:20.806 --> 00:17:22.433
You're one of those
"Defenders," too, huh?

00:17:22.541 --> 00:17:25.772
Careful, now! These two
are your friends, right?!

00:17:26.178 --> 00:17:28.373
You don't want anything unpleasant
to happen to them, do you?

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:29.139
Highness!

00:17:29.247 --> 00:17:30.578
Laharl!

00:17:31.717 --> 00:17:33.844
What are you two doing?

00:17:33.952 --> 00:17:34.941
Being held prisoner, duh!

00:17:35.087 --> 00:17:38.750
Be careful! This man
is really, really tough!

00:17:38.890 --> 00:17:41.222
He's Mr. Gordon's rival!

00:17:41.793 --> 00:17:43.385
That's a human
for you.

00:17:43.628 --> 00:17:47.826
You have potential, trying to threaten me
by taking hostages.

00:17:48.467 --> 00:17:51.095
But taking hostages
won't work with me!

00:17:51.436 --> 00:17:53.404
Laharl, you're joking!

00:17:53.505 --> 00:17:56.531
Yeah, I guess that trying to strong-arm
the Prince by taking hostages...

00:17:56.675 --> 00:17:58.666
...would only make him happy,
wouldn't it?

00:17:59.011 --> 00:18:02.913
You don't say? In that case,
I'll just have to give THIS a try!

00:18:14.359 --> 00:18:15.826
It's resonating?

00:18:17.362 --> 00:18:18.351
Fire!

00:18:20.032 --> 00:18:20.726
Highness!

00:18:20.832 --> 00:18:22.060
Laharl!

00:18:22.467 --> 00:18:26.096
Most impressive... We should have
used this in the first place.

00:18:27.539 --> 00:18:30.337
It has a devastating effect
on demons, all right!

00:18:30.742 --> 00:18:33.575
Now I get it... This is exactly the
same as when I tried to hold...

00:18:35.013 --> 00:18:38.949
Flonne, don't tell me that that
beam just now uses Celestian...

00:18:39.818 --> 00:18:41.080
But why?

00:18:45.557 --> 00:18:47.047
You're still standing, eh?

00:18:47.159 --> 00:18:50.720
Of course I am.
Who do you think I am?

00:18:51.029 --> 00:18:52.826
I'm the mighty
Overlord Laharl!

00:18:52.931 --> 00:18:55.729
The Netherworld will fall
under human control.

00:18:55.834 --> 00:19:00.066
Thursday here has been relaying information
about the various places he's been,

00:19:00.405 --> 00:19:03.932
...providing us with data on the Netherworld,
which we previously knew nothing about.

00:19:04.042 --> 00:19:05.373
BEEP BEEP BLIP BEEP.

00:19:05.477 --> 00:19:06.774
Gee, keep up the
good work.

00:19:06.878 --> 00:19:11.144
What's more, Thursday had a top-secret
mission to set up a system of devices...

00:19:11.483 --> 00:19:15.317
...that would open a dimensional rift which
would allow us to enter the Netherworld.

00:19:15.921 --> 00:19:19.482
Needless to say, that project was carried out
by Jennifer, Thursday's inventor,

00:19:19.591 --> 00:19:22.924
...under the orders of her father,
Supreme Commander Carter.

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:27.125
You're back, Jennifer!

00:19:27.866 --> 00:19:29.390
Father...

00:19:29.668 --> 00:19:34.503
That sounds impressive, all right, but your
little scheme was actually pretty pedestrian.

00:19:35.073 --> 00:19:37.007
So Mr. Gordon was...

00:19:37.275 --> 00:19:38.867
He was kept in the dark
about it.

00:19:38.977 --> 00:19:44.279
We needed a clueless scapegoat
to keep you people distracted.

00:19:44.416 --> 00:19:46.646
You're the
clueless one here.

00:19:47.052 --> 00:19:49.452
You make it sound like you
did all this yourselves,

00:19:49.588 --> 00:19:52.352
...but you humans had help setting up
this invasion, didn't you?

00:19:53.058 --> 00:19:54.389
Chew on this.

00:19:56.561 --> 00:19:57.550
Highness!

00:19:57.662 --> 00:19:58.822
Laharl!

00:20:15.714 --> 00:20:16.578
That hurt!

00:20:16.681 --> 00:20:18.478
Hey, go easy on the
merchandise, pal!

00:20:18.583 --> 00:20:19.880
SILENCE, DEMON!

00:20:19.985 --> 00:20:21.646
Why, you little...

00:20:24.289 --> 00:20:25.381
Etna!

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:27.390
Damn it, that hurt!

00:20:28.527 --> 00:20:29.926
Jennifer...

00:20:30.028 --> 00:20:33.122
I'm sorry that I got you two
involved in all this...

00:20:33.465 --> 00:20:35.456
Jennifer, you have
to tell me!

00:20:35.667 --> 00:20:40.127
As a Celestian, there's something
that I have to know!

00:20:41.339 --> 00:20:43.864
I don't think we have any further
need for the hostages.

00:20:44.276 --> 00:20:46.642
They still have some value
as bargaining chips.

00:20:47.479 --> 00:20:51.813
They do, eh?
In that case, I'll leave them to you.

00:20:52.817 --> 00:20:56.844
Gentlemen, the Overlord has fallen!
Now for the final blow!

00:20:57.255 --> 00:21:01.055
We'll burn the Netherworld to the ground
and remake it into a world fit for humans!

00:21:01.626 --> 00:21:04.060
Prepare to fire
Astro Particle Cannon!

00:21:04.429 --> 00:21:06.624
Prepare to fire
Astro Particle Cannon!

00:21:37.295 --> 00:21:38.284
Oh, it's you?

00:21:38.396 --> 00:21:40.125
Please, I need
your help!

00:21:40.232 --> 00:21:44.191
Oh, so a human wants to make
a deal with this devil, huh?

00:21:44.703 --> 00:21:50.198
Call it what you will! For the sake of those tears
in Jennifer's eyes, I have to go after her!

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:52.936
Go if you want.

00:21:53.311 --> 00:21:54.710
But...

00:21:58.683 --> 00:22:02.551
Those bastards have gone
and made me REALLY angry!

00:22:03.088 --> 00:22:06.546
Energy charge in progress.
100... 200...

00:22:07.025 --> 00:22:08.458
Safety locks disengaged!

00:22:08.560 --> 00:22:10.027
Engage anti-flash defenses!

00:22:10.128 --> 00:22:11.288
Firing preparations complete!

00:22:11.563 --> 00:22:12.530
Open fire!

00:22:12.631 --> 00:22:13.928
Fire!

00:22:22.674 --> 00:22:24.835
To Be Continued

00:22:40.959 --> 00:22:48.388
If people ever notice the cycle of time
on this world where blue skies come and go,

00:22:48.733 --> 00:22:56.469
something's bound to happen when people
with different outlooks get together.

00:22:56.775 --> 00:23:04.614
Will we be buried by our desires?
Will love come and save the day?

00:23:04.716 --> 00:23:11.679
Either way, it doesn't matter to me.
I'm gonna do as I please.

00:23:12.357 --> 00:23:20.128
Light and shadow, egoists for whom
everything in the world has meaning,

00:23:20.231 --> 00:23:27.933
every little fragment lives his life
with the balance on their shoulders.

00:23:28.039 --> 00:23:35.343
Doing whatever we want,
having it exactly the way we want it.

00:23:36.047 --> 00:23:39.778
Right now,
under the same sky,

00:23:39.884 --> 00:23:43.877
light and shadow
repeat again and again.

00:23:44.789 --> 00:23:49.089
Chain react...

00:23:56.267 --> 00:24:00.601
The terrible Gordon, Defender of Earth,
launches a sudden attack on the Netherworld!

00:24:00.839 --> 00:24:02.636
Don't be so melodramatic.

00:24:02.741 --> 00:24:06.074
Rising up to defend the Netherworld as it bears
the brunt of the humans' cruel atrocities...

00:24:06.177 --> 00:24:08.270
...is Etna, the
babe messiah!

00:24:08.580 --> 00:24:11.674
Rise up and fight, Etna!
The Netherworld has been waiting for you!

00:24:11.850 --> 00:24:13.681
Nobody's waiting
for YOU, lady.

00:24:13.785 --> 00:24:17.744
Next time on Disgaea!
"The Defender of Tomorrow is You!"

00:24:18.089 --> 00:24:18.953
Who do you mean?

00:24:19.057 --> 00:24:19.958
Well, like it says,
it's "you"!

00:24:19.958 --> 00:24:20.658
Next Time:
The Defender of Tomorrow is You!
Well, like it says,
it's "you"!

00:24:20.658 --> 00:24:22.193
Next Time:
The Defender of Tomorrow is You!
Oh, it's ME?

00:24:22.193 --> 00:24:24.855
Next Time:
The Defender of Tomorrow is You!
